<BR>
<CENTER><B><FONT="+2">30 Days in the News</FONT></B></CENTER>

<BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Congratulations Rong!!!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - October 29th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Today Rong joined the Rank of Celestial Fists as he completed his Epic quest, so next time you see him give him a big hooray!</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:cdc608@aol.com>Tienen</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Venril Sathir remains!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Friday - October 26th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Ok so Its a lil late on posting, because i just logged at 5 am, but Grats everyone on an excellent raid on VSR! Wende and Myself owe you all a huge debt of gratitude. Thats all for now)</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:cdc608@aol.com>Tienen</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Registered</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - October 22nd 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>I've gone through the members list and changed the status on some members that I haven't seen in a few months such that they will no longer appear in the members list or the statistics.  If they appear at some point in the future, I'll change their status back.  If you happen to be one of these people, please e-mail me to have your status changed back.<BR>
Of the remaining 37 members listed, 13 haven't activated their accounts for this website.  This either means they've never been to this site or don't see the point.  To those of you who have activated your accounts, thank you very much and please encourage your fellow guild members to do the same.<BR>
I have yet to add a few new members like Deyna, Boonkie, and Rong.  I intend for them to add their characters here by using the site's registration function.  I'll merely change their status to <u>member</u> once they've done so.</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Kael Raid</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Sunday - October 21st 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Had another great time in Kael :><BR>
We started a little late, but I hope that we'll be able to shave time off of that as we continue to do these raids.  The sooner we start, the more time is spent keeling giants.<BR>
<TABLE align="CENTER" border="1" cellpadding="2"><TR>
<TD>Skrambold</TD><TD>Circlet of Tallon</TD></TR>
<TR><TD>Futtal</TD><TD>Black Blade of Tormenting<BR>Corroded Plate Greaves</TD></TR>
<TR><TD>Orlo</TD><TD>Corroded Plate Helm<BR>Boots of Dark Passage</TD></TR>
<TR><TD>Deyna</TD><TD>Defiance</TD></TR>
<TR><TD>Roldanious</TD><TD>Torn Enchanted Silk Turban</TD></TR>
<TR><TD>Fumbles</TD><TD>Gladiator's Chain Sleeves</TD></TR>
</TABLE>
<BR>
I'm believe a few other notable pieces dropped but I'll have to modify this post when I find my list hehe.<BR>
We also had things like a Velium War Mask, Hammer of Rage, and Axe of Frost drop.  Not extreemly noteworthy items.  They'll be given to lower level members, alternate characters, or sold to help fund guild services and events.
</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>What's New?</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Friday - October 19th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>I've managed to grant the capability for some guild members to post news items.  The current system is not 100% bug proof, so please be patient.<BR>
If you get any errors when attempting to submit or edit news, please e-mail me EXACTLY what you were trying to submit/edit and what error resulted.</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Awesome Weekend!!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - October 15th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Legerdemain had an awesome weekend! :><BR>
Ninden got Renux killed and now only (hehe only) needs to kill the General in Kithcore to be epicafied.  I'm sure he'll be researching this and letting us know exactly what we need to do.  Keep an eye on the message boards for it.<BR>
From what I was told, a few Legerdemain members hooked up in a pickup group in Sebilis.  There was laughing, crying (mostly Tienen :P~), and hella lot of killing going on in the Crypt.  They made off with Phat lewt too! :><BR>
Sunday was surely a full day.  We woke up early and hit the Arena in Kael.  Once again, Rong joined us as did Kiglan.  Unfortunately, the drops weren't nearly as awesome as they were last time, but we did get a few good pieces for five or so hours of fun.  I'll try to record more accuratly what drops as we continue our Sunday Kael hunts.<BR>
About an hour later, Charasik summoned us to the Wakening Lands to help finish his Phenocryst's Focus quest.  Rong moved in to help us once again.  Orlo bit the big one while trying to lead some mobs to our spot, though :<  After the whole thing was over, Orlo went afk and was splatted by some Geonids getting revenge hehe.  Gratz Charasik!<BR>
Shortly after that all happened, we put 2 groups together and headed off towards the Dragon Necropolis.  Once again, Rong was helping us out.  We sat and killed Chetari rats for several hours.  We also got molested by a hord of beetles every half hour or so hehe.  We did notice that Rong seemed to take quite a bit of pleasure beating up the rat children though... hmmm hehehe.  We got three of them bone shield thingies, a new axe for Orlo, a nice 1hs for Ninden, a weapon off those beetles for Sagera, quite a few quest gems (updated in the armory), and a whole bunch of fun :>.  3 of the gems we got were Pristine Emeralds.  Know anybody who could use those Charasik??  hehehe<BR>
Awesome weekend everyone!!<BR></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>



</font>
